{
  "text": "UI Audit Restaurant A\nKIOSK ADMIN\nAhmedabad Flagship Store\nAPP\nRestaurant Admin\nKiosk Admin\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLogout\nWorkspace\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch · MAIN\nUI Audit Second Branch A · UIA2\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nKIOSK OPERATIONS\nDashboard\nKiosk Terminals\nOrders\nLive Orders / KDS\nFloor / Tables\nCUSTOMER EXPERIENCE\nMenu & Categories\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nKiosk Welcome Screen\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nOffers & Coupons\nPAYMENTS & SERVICE\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nCustomer Feedback\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nReports & Analytics\nSYSTEM\nKiosk Settings\nSync & Devices\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nPrinters & Peripheral Devices\nESC/POS HARDWARE\n\nConfigure ESC/POS thermal printers (80mm/58mm), KOT station routing, and run test prints.\n\nConfigure Printer\nPOS COUNTER PC\nCounter Terminal\nLocalhost Active\nRECEIPT PRINTERS\nThermal 80mm ESC/POS\n0 Configured\nCASH DRAWER\nRJ11 Kick Solenoid\nAuto-Open on Bill\nLAN MESH BRIDGE\nMulti-Device Sync\nPort 5178 Listening\nNo Thermal Printers Configured\n\nConnect your 80mm or 58mm ESC/POS receipt or kitchen KOT printer via LAN Ethernet, USB, or Bluetooth.\n\n+ Configure First Printer\nLAN Sync Bridge & Cross-Machine Pairing\nMULTI-DEVICE SYNC\n\nSynchronize POS Counter PCs, Admin Laptops, Captain APKs, and Kitchen KDS screens over the local Wi-Fi / LAN network.\n\nForce Sync Now\nLocal Core setup\n\nActivate this device first. Enter the six-digit pairing PIN shown in the Local Core server console. Pair each app once for this restaurant and branch. Cloud login and cloud sync work independently.\n\nLocal Core address\nPairing PIN\nPair Local Core\nMain POS Counter Server Address (LAN Host IP:Port):\nSave & Connect\nTip: If this is the Main Counter PC, leave as http://localhost:5178. On other laptops/tablets, enter the Main PC's LAN IP.\nConnection Health & Latency:\nTest Ping & Latency\nKitchen Printer Routing\n\nWhich physical printer handles each kitchen station's tickets\n\nMain Kitchen / Curry Station:\nUnassigned (falls back to default printer)\nTandoor Section:\nUnassigned (falls back to default printer)\nBeverages Bar:\nUnassigned (falls back to default printer)\nDessert Counter:\nUnassigned (falls back to default printer)\nTransactional Print Queue Spooler\n0 Jobs Total\nProcess Queue Now\n\nNo print jobs in spooler queue. Jobs dispatched upon customer payment will appear here.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
